{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320306001:1":{"text":"原谅我的冒昧，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，这样着急地邀请你过来。","source_cn":"原谅我的冒昧，<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1860D5B58CD20628","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"原谅我的冒昧，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，这样着急地邀请你过来。","female":"原谅我的冒昧，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，这样着急地邀请你过来。","variant_male_record_index":"145713","variant_female_record_index":"145714","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320306002:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡说你想找一位画家，对方是谁呀？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡说你想找一位画家，对方是谁呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0A88F4583A571D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320306003:1":{"text":"来吧，先看看这幅画。","source_cn":"来吧，先看看这幅画。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2A76A7BD4CCD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::2":{"text":"残破的画作","source_cn":"残破的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF773940056FD220C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320306004:1":{"text":"你们觉得如何？","source_cn":"你们觉得如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8570D8B993F25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320306004":{"text":"你们觉得如何？","source_cn":"你们觉得如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8570D8B993F25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320306007:2":{"text":"这幅画的作者，就是你想找的那个人吗？","source_cn":"这幅画的作者，就是你想找的那个人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F54B8B6D994B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320306008:1":{"text":"是的。","source_cn":"是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B8A1FE2CBD23183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320306009:1":{"text":"在我看来，这幅画画技高超，充满灵气。能用寥寥几笔就完成氛围的塑造，说明它的作者极富潜力。","source_cn":"在我看来，这幅画画技高超，充满灵气。能用寥寥几笔就完成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D2D81AC03BDD33E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320306010:1":{"text":"只可惜这幅画没有完成，也不知遭遇过什么，竟然破损至此……我很好奇它背后的故事。","source_cn":"只可惜这幅画没有完成，也不知遭遇过什么，竟然破损至此…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AEE25C1C1E859C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320306011:1":{"text":"但我一直隐居，认识的人类屈指可数。只能拜托瓦丽卡请你们帮忙。","source_cn":"但我一直隐居，认识的人类屈指可数。只能拜托瓦丽卡请你们帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD45CB5EDB78742","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320306012:1":{"text":"唔，那你知道这幅画是哪里来的吗？","source_cn":"唔，那你知道这幅画是哪里来的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x871AB2A0A7874AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320306013:1":{"text":"这是一位为我长期提供艺术品的商人送来的，我用很低的价格买下了它。","source_cn":"这是一位为我长期提供艺术品的商人送来的，我用很低的价格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047C50FBFFB4C838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320306014:1":{"text":"她自称<style=\"highlight\">黑鸦商人</style>，是为数不多敢于进入黑沼森林的人。至于真名，我并不清楚。","source_cn":"她自称<style=highlight>黑鸦商人</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB48216BCC0C6A625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320306015:1":{"text":"没关系。既然你和她做生意，总见过她的长相吧？","source_cn":"没关系。既然你和她做生意，总见过她的长相吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2413DEB53DCA745F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320306016:1":{"text":"……很遗憾，我和她从未见过面。","source_cn":"……很遗憾，我和她从未见过面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670A0418908F5B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320306017:1":{"text":"每次交易，都是由她将货物放在约定的地点，我取走时留下购买费用，附加一笔辛苦费。","source_cn":"每次交易，都是由她将货物放在约定的地点，我取走时留下购...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C412F1F8B963A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320306018:1":{"text":"不知道真名也不知道长相……这下可难办了……","source_cn":"不知道真名也不知道长相……这下可难办了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x873B7312F45077D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320306019:1":{"text":"要不我们去柳博米尔和黑鸦商人约定的地方看看？说不定对方会留下一些线索！","source_cn":"要不我们去柳博米尔和黑鸦商人约定的地方看看？说不定对方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8444E1B0447A88D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320306020:2":{"text":"只能麻烦你们过去看看了。黑沼森林<style=\"highlight\">瀑布北边的枯树下</style>，就是我和她约定的地点。","source_cn":"只能麻烦你们过去看看了。黑沼森林<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDBC859BA18BA8B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320306021:0":{"text":"你说的地方是不是在通往庄园的那条近路上？","source_cn":"你说的地方是不是在通往庄园的那条近路上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF54616DA2F8CFC61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320306022:0":{"text":"……如果你愿意蹚过沼泽，那确实是条近路。","source_cn":"……如果你愿意蹚过沼泽，那确实是条近路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BC904E2B886E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1320306023:0":{"text":"我来的时候看到那里有个人类，或许就是你说的黑鸦商人。","source_cn":"我来的时候看到那里有个人类，或许就是你说的黑鸦商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B020493C4FE6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1320306024:0":{"text":"和人类打交道的事，恐怕我也不方便出面。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我就不陪你们去了。","source_cn":"和人类打交道的事，恐怕我也不方便出面。<style=s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x19A460D18C5CEEDB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"和人类打交道的事，恐怕我也不方便出面。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我就不陪你们去了。","female":"和人类打交道的事，恐怕我也不方便出面。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我就不陪你们去了。","variant_male_record_index":"145739","variant_female_record_index":"145740","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1320306025:1":{"text":"放心吧，我们一定会帮柳博米尔打听到那位画家的消息！","source_cn":"放心吧，我们一定会帮柳博米尔打听到那位画家的消息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E50E8C4903B1647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choi